Sentence|Translation
Jau met la sutga sin il palantschieu|I put the chair o the floor
Met jau la televisiun sin la maisa?|Do I put the television on the table?
Jau na vegn betg a metter la stgaffa sin il canapè, perquai che la stgaffa è greva|I will not put the cupboard on the sofa because the cupboard is heavy
Jau sun sin il palantschieu|I am on the floor
Vuls ti metter la maisa qua?|Do you want to put the table here?
Nus mettain la sutga en ina chasa|We put the chair in a house
Nus na mettain betg il palantschieu là|We don't put the floor there
Ti mettas la televisiun en in'abitaziun|You put the television in an apartment
Mettas ti la maisa e il canapè sin il palantschieu?|Do you put the table and the sofa on the floor?
El metta la stgaffa cun la sutga|He puts the cupboard with the chair
Metta el la sutga qua?|Does he put the cupboard here?
Ella metta ina fraja sin il canapè|She puts a strawberry on the sofa
Ella na metta betg in tartuffel sin il palantschieu|She doesn't put a potato on the floor
Mettan els la maisa u la stgaffa sin la sutga?|Do they put the table or the cupboard on the chair?
